{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>The woman whom You gave with me.</b> To be for me a help, and I was entitled to rely on her not to do me anything but help; for this reason I accepted from her. Also, I did not know from which tree she gave it to me — this is as it is written, <b>she gave me from the tree</b>, and it is not written 'from the tree of knowledge.' And he was ungrateful, for the Holy One, blessed be He, gave her to him for good, and he considered her for evil."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:41.514052099Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}